cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
  - family-names: George
    given-names: Robert Joseph
title: "Formalization of the Millennium Prize Problem Statements in Lean 4"
version: 3.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-07
abstract: >-
  A formalization of the seven Millennium Prize Problem statements in the Lean 4 theorem prover.
  This project aims to represent these famous mathematical statements in a
  machine-checkable format, including the Hodge Conjecture, Navier-Stokes Equations,
  P vs NP Problem, Riemann Hypothesis, Yang-Mills Existence and Mass Gap,
  Birch and Swinnerton-Dyer Conjecture, and Poincaré Conjecture.
keywords:
  - formal verification
  - theorem proving
  - Lean4
  - millennium problems
  - mathematics
  - formalization
license: Apache-2.0
